{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1000_p", "source_sha256": "62c0d59705599c1187cf4cc1af7954d893892ee017a8194a9a80d61442b2e734", "ja": "（今日は、このみさんと歩が出演するドラマの撮影だ。\nブラックサンタの二人がレースで競うことになる……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄这个美和步出演的电视剧。两个黑色圣诞老人要在比赛中一决胜负……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "21349c5aa7fce98728320f9ba5b9d07f27aff8251b92ffc6c99426c4e52c17e7", "ja": "前からあなたのことは気に入らないと思ってたの。\nちょっと目立つからって勘違いしてない？", "zh": "我从以前就看你不顺眼。\n不就是稍微显眼一点吗，别自以为是了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d0aa625b77a7502ef17673ae6c96186c56828082f6832e5256adab4c4fcb3863", "ja": "それはこっちのセリフだよ。\n年上だからって偉そうにしてさ。大事なのは実力だろ？", "zh": "这话应该我来说吧。\n不就是年纪大一点嘛，摆什么架子。重要的是实力吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ee43096780ddc01078a5f0da31de8be2d674153302eaf0f52b44cec9bdef2112", "ja": "お、おい、ふたりとも……！\n大きな声でどうしたんだ？", "zh": "喂、喂，你们两个……！\n怎么突然这么大声？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "d3ae31bd5fdff8231367132c640c923aaa59b1c6d90fa541b367bc1ac13bb189", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、お疲れさま。\nごめんなさい、ちょっと声が大きかったかしら。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，辛苦了。\n抱歉，刚才是不是声音有点大？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c9ccdd410d11ac18c2f0c426adb0e40acd15d873920cf3db302038714a917594", "ja": "……あれ？　なんか{$P$}、\n汗かいてない？　どうかしたの？", "zh": "……咦？{$P$}你好像\n流汗了？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2f600d1c426bb31bd3d6e1db9424b9337220b4783ee12debcd8e10b811867cd5", "ja": "え、えーと……喧嘩、ではない……？", "zh": "呃、呃……这、不是在吵架……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "893557621bfaaf2f9878bd089ecb303222d037204efb9db8aa8309b598a22a74", "ja": "ふふっ、勘違いさせちゃったみたいね。\n今のは喧嘩じゃなくて、気合いを入れてたの。", "zh": "呵呵，好像让你误会了呢。\n刚才那不是在吵架，而是在给自己鼓劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1008_p", "source_sha256": "88826df7c47fc3516029093986d5791f4d13939ab2d4744937bbcb12047e5cca", "ja": "気合いを？", "zh": "打起精神？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8e1d5ba35c0cbf8c6cddc8c2dadbe9f3f8be783e9a9625e989817a580e21ab2c", "ja": "うん。今日は、バチバチの熱いシーンから撮り始める\nでしょ？　だからテンション上げないとって話してさ。", "zh": "嗯。今天要从火花四溅的热血场面开始拍摄，\n所以得先把情绪调动起来嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "bb43db47ab3f95cbbf3e692183f0e3c5e1a5f3b66593488b53f00e4815738ff4", "ja": "私達は、先輩後輩でライバル……。\n遠慮なんてしたら、いい演技はできないもの。", "zh": "我们既是前辈和后辈，也是竞争对手……要是有所顾虑，可演不出好戏来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7f5218c1fc92ec54769700b43ef844495b06e4574f86ed0099f7efb0ddcefd86", "ja": "そうだったんですね。本気で二人が喧嘩してると思って\n……はあ～、びっくりした。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。我还以为你们两个是真的在吵架……\n……呼～，吓我一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2241fcca2edd1665249ffc480e5ddd7eb834f48213cfd5490e365662b19adad7", "ja": "あははっ！　だってさ、このみさん。\n{$P$}が言うなら、心配いらないね。", "zh": "啊哈哈！因为啊，这不是木实姐嘛。\n既然{$P$}都这么说了，就不用担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "28b2ef8453960f52ae0af33fcd9fa5517f7192c47dab5ada8e4751431b959446", "ja": "ふふ、そうね。この役、加減が難しいから助かったわ。\nだって、鼻につく先輩でライバルっていう……。", "zh": "呵呵，说得也是。这角色很难拿捏，真是帮大忙了。\n毕竟要演一个惹人讨厌的前辈兼对手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "edcf9b013217df32bf0b1c4f60db56982b771790997c662d66452e45d79164c8", "ja": "待って？　もしかして普段の私も、周りから\nこんな風に思われて……。二人共、違うわよね！？", "zh": "等一下？难道平时周围的人，\n也是这么看我的……你们两个，不是这样的对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0f89ffe0b73bd3923d20238146f4c99cd230e68178a2cac9a6b423ed35ac66ce", "ja": "うん、違う違う。このみさんは、劇場で一番頼りになる\nお姉さんだよ！　ね、{$P$}？", "zh": "嗯，不是的不是的。木实姐可是剧场里最可靠的大姐姐！对吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5441172431ad3b0300c3cce582b7d043d5b011a1fe21d8173b5c29b429231aea", "ja": "はい。心配する必要はないですよ、このみさん。\n俺もいつも頼りにさせてもらってます！", "zh": "是的，没必要担心哦，此方小姐。\n我也一直都很依赖您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "11110c15f3fe7caf839330676090a68d20c6cfa6119a39eb6da48fdbed3d4324", "ja": "歩ちゃん、{$P$}……！", "zh": "小步，{$P$}……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "14cc381044a8e5f93b2507b2139bb676e8bca2bcf966227f18ef96e077028ad2", "ja": "今日の撮影も頼りにしてるよ、このみさん。\nこのみさんの本気、期待してるね♪　へへっ。", "zh": "今天的拍摄也拜托你了，这个美姐。\n我很期待这个美姐认真起来的样子哦♪嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "a356ecfcfdaa4691daea4fbbdda4b429c6ceb92833509ff28181b232bb4f3546", "ja": "歩ちゃん……。いいじゃない！\nお姉さんの本気みせてあげるわ。うふふ♪", "zh": "步……这样才对嘛！\n让你见识一下姐姐的真本事。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1020_null", "source_sha256": "41653696cc58b74d90f461b5071b0b8d7ca2c51eb7877fb67a39562da67d4780", "ja": "撮影開始……", "zh": "节目开拍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "d7e67a66ba2987881a8eafc7e110d066d69d374f7b0e0b781e26af08676c8d5d", "ja": "「クリスマスの夜を制するのは、この私よ！\nあなたは大人しく私の背中でも眺めてなさいっ！」", "zh": "“称霸圣诞夜的，可是我哦！\n你就乖乖看着我的背影吧！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8cb3af51b4aea8cff63ac0537b8e2a2a1ecbb1c4a6de45e99ca091d6faabf51d", "ja": "「はいそうですかって引き下がれるか。レースに先輩も\n後輩も関係ない……アタシは絶対に負けないよ！」", "zh": "「谁会乖乖就这么退缩啊。比赛可不分什么前辈\n后辈……我绝对不会输的！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0524_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1d6d00ea989722e6cf9d8d1f37a0101bb843298554cb2601d678fe7ff8a6e9ba", "ja": "（二人の本気が伝わってくる熱いシーンに、現場の\n士気も上がった。この後の撮影も期待できそうだな！）", "zh": "（两人的认真劲儿传达出来了，这段热血的场面也让现场的士气高涨起来。看来接下来的拍摄也值得期待了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
